img class="benin-liens-cta__bg" src="/assets/img/frontiere-640x480.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy"><div class="generic-block-header marg-bottom-sm"><div class="generic-block-titles flex-container flex-dir-column align-center align-middle text-center"><div class="generic-block-texts has-title"><h2 class="generic-block-title">e-Visa Bénin</h2></div></div></div><div class="cta-desc text-center"><h3>Plateforme officielle</h3><p>Obtenez votre visa électronique directement sur la plateforme gouvernementale, avant votre départ. <strong>Seule adresse fiable</strong> — les sites tiers facturent des frais inutiles.</p></div><div class="cell medium-4 cta-actions flex-container flex-dir-column align-center"><ul class="list-unstyled flex-container align-center align-middle wrap grid-gap-sm"><li class="list-item"><div class="woody-component-button padd-top-sm "><a class="woody-component-button button primary normal" href="https://evisa.gouv.bj/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Demander mon e-Visa (nouvel onglet)"><span class="button-label" data-label="Demander mon e-Visa">Demander mon e-Visa</span><span class="button-arrow"></span></a></div></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="cell xmedium-down-order-9"><div class="woody-component woody-component-cta tpl_03 flex-container flex-dir-column align-center bg-primary bg-gradient bg-filigrane isRel padd-all-md large-padd-all-lg no-sessions" data-equalizer="data-equalizer"><img class="benin-liens-cta__bg" src="/assets/img/sante-640x480.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy"><div class="generic-block-header marg-bottom-sm"><div class="generic-block-titles flex-container flex-dir-column align-center align-middle text-center"><div class="generic-block-texts has-title"><h2 class="generic-block-title">Institut Pasteur — santé du voyageur</h2></div></div></div><div class="cta-desc text-center"><p>Recommandations sanitaires pour préparer votre voyage au Bénin : vaccination fièvre jaune (obligatoire), paludisme, hygiène alimentaire, trousse à pharmacie.</p></div><div class="cell medium-4 cta-actions flex-container flex-dir-column align-center"><ul class="list-unstyled flex-container align-center align-middle wrap grid-gap-sm"><li class="list-item"><div class="woody-component-button padd-top-sm "><a class="woody-component-button button primary normal" href="https://www.pasteur.fr/fr/centre-medical/preparer-son-voyage/benin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Consulter la fiche Bénin (nouvel onglet)"><span class="button-label" data-label="Consulter la fiche Bénin">Consulter la fiche Bénin</span><span class="button-arrow"></span></a></div></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="cell xmedium-down-order-9"><div class="woody-component woody-component-cta tpl_03 flex-container flex-dir-column align-center bg-primary bg-gradient bg-filigrane isRel padd-all-md large-padd-all-lg no-sessions" data-equalizer="data-equalizer"><img class="benin-liens-cta__bg" src="/assets/img/paysage-640x480.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy"><div class="generic-block-header marg-bottom-sm"><div class="generic-block-titles flex-container flex-dir-column align-center align-middle text-center"><div class="generic-block-texts has-title"><h2 class="generic-block-title">Conseils aux voyageurs</h2></div></div></div><div class="cta-desc text-center"><p>Le zonage sécuritaire actualisé par votre ministère des Affaires étrangères. C'est lui qui conditionne votre assurance voyage.</p><p><strong>France :</strong> France Diplomatie<br><strong>Belgique :</strong> SPF Affaires étrangères<br><strong>Canada :</strong> voyage.gc.ca<br><strong>Suisse :</strong> DFAE</p></div><div class="cell medium-4 cta-actions flex-container flex-dir-column align-center"><ul class="list-unstyled flex-container align-center align-middle wrap grid-gap-sm"><li class="list-item"><div class="woody-component-button padd-top-sm "><a class="woody-component-button button primary normal" href="https://www.diplomatie.gouv.fr/fr/conseils-aux-voyageurs/conseils-par-pays-destination/benin/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Consulter France Diplomatie (nouvel onglet)"><span class="button-label" data-label="Consulter France Diplomatie">Consulter France Diplomatie</span><span class="button-arrow"></span></a></div></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="cell xmedium-down-order-9"><div class="woody-component woody-component-cta tpl_03 flex-container flex-dir-column align-center bg-primary bg-gradient bg-filigrane isRel padd-all-md large-padd-all-lg no-sessions" data-equalizer="data-equalizer"><img class="benin-liens-cta__bg" src="/assets/img/gateway/securite-benin.jpg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy"><div class="generic-block-header marg-bottom-sm"><div class="generic-block-titles flex-container flex-dir-column align-center align-middle text-center"><div class="generic-block-texts has-title"><h2 class="generic-block-title">Numéros d'urgence au Bénin</h2></div></div></div><div class="cta-desc text-center"><h3>Joignables 24 h / 24 depuis un téléphone béninois</h3><p><strong>Police secours :</strong> 117<br><strong>Sapeurs-pompiers :</strong> 118<br><strong>Gendarmerie :</strong> 119<br><strong>SAMU :</strong> 166</p></div><div class="cell medium-4 cta-actions flex-container flex-dir-column align-center"><ul class="list-unstyled flex-container align-center align-middle wrap grid-gap-sm"><li class="list-item"><div class="woody-component-button padd-top-sm "><a class="woody-component-button button primary normal" href="tel:166" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Appeler le SAMU (166) (nouvel onglet)"><span class="button-label" data-label="Appeler le SAMU (166)">Appeler le SAMU (166)</span><span class="button-arrow"></span></a></div></li></ul><div class="cta-phone padd-top-sm padd-bottom-sm"><a class="phone-number-action" href="tel:+2290167110220" data-phone="+229 01 67 11 02 20" data-page-type="infos-pratiques" data-title="Les l